    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38123" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praetōrīcĭus</span></b>  or
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-tĭus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>prœtorian</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praetoricia corona,</span>”
