					8, 33, 1</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <i>one who has been
			prœtor</i>, <i>an ex-prœtor</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Inscr. Grut. 398, 1</span></i>.</div>
